WEBVTT

00:00:00.107 --> 00:00:05.760
Fee overview

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:12.013
Open Finance, then Fee Overview. It shows the status of fees at a glance.

00:00:13.686 --> 00:00:17.645
Choose Monthly or Annual view, then the month and year.

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:23.122
Category-wise Collection shows how much of each fee category is collected.

00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:30.387
The Collection Progress bar shows how much of the total due has been paid.

00:00:30.938 --> 00:00:36.766
Use Collect Payments to record payments, or Fee Setup to change the fee amounts.

00:00:40.468 --> 00:00:45.149
Fees at a glance
